# Trial by Wind (outlands 194), the battlefield's arms without a win. Accepted without the fork: WP_Entrance opens no
# menu (the fork is required). Available with the fork: no menu (BattlefieldQuest's entry wants the status at accepted or
# more; a status read that stays in Lua). Accepted with the fork: entered (the fork taken), then left through
# Wind_Protocrystal (32003, option 4: leaveBattlefield): no 32001, no whisper; Agado-Pugado then has neither key item:
# 107 (a new fork).
char zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.TrialByWind accepted
login
trigger WP_Entrance                       # accepted, no fork: no menu
finish-if-event
keyitem TuningForkOfWind
quest Outlands.TrialByWind available
trigger WP_Entrance                       # available, the fork: no menu
finish-if-event
quest Outlands.TrialByWind accepted
trigger WP_Entrance                       # accepted, the fork: 32000
update 32000 option=1                     # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
trigger Wind_Protocrystal                # the exit: 32003
finish option=4                           # left: no win
warp -16.5,7.8,-10.5 Rabao
trigger Agado-Pugado                      # accepted, neither key item: 107
finish                                    # a new fork
